    "detailed_description": "This is a game about energy, flesh and what's in between.<br><br>Engage in strategic, turn-based battles where every decision counts. Collect and equip powerful weapons, armor, and relics to shape your character. Recruit and lead your party to triumph against the stars.<br><br><i>! Around you, the air is filled with powerful entities, both ancient and malevolent. Commune with these beings to harness their powers !</i><br><br>Journey through various landscapes, from deserts to lush forests, treacherous caves, and ancient cities. Each location offers unique challenges, secrets, and opportunities. Uncover the lore of these lands through an immersive dialogue system. You can befriend, betray, or outwit those you meet.",
